  "briefing": "Corvid Syndicate holds Altiplano through its freight sidings. Reconnect 2 relays, download the records from the vault server, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 10 enemy agents and 4 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Altiplano Audit: Corvid Syndicate runs Altiplano from its freight sidings, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, download the records and walk out the exit.",
  "debrief": {
    "success": "Altiplano wakes up with the freight sidings in other hands. Your team is back in the dark before morning.",
    "failure": "The team is down in Altiplano before the work was done. Regroup and try a different approach."
  },
